:: Black Wolf Gifts
<<effects>>
<<set _gift to setup.foodstuff[$gift].name + (setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>>
<<wearProp _gift>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	"I've brought you something," you say.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	"I made something," you say. "Just for you."
<<else>>
	"I've made you a gift," you say. "I hope you like it."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $gift is "valentines_chocolate" and $valentines>>
	<<earnFeat "Be My Valentine">>
	The black wolf sniffs the box, uncertain, but curious. <<bHe>> bites it, and waves it around in <<bhis>> jaw, tearing it to shreds and sending chocolate flying in all directions.
	<br><br>
	The ribbon is caught by a breeze, and floats some distance before landing on a pup's nose. Another grabs it, which gets the attention of the others.
	<br><br>
	The pups are soon scrapping over who gets to play with their new "toy".

	<<if $monster gte 1>>
		The black wolf seems pleased.
	<<else>>
		The black wolf flashes <<bhis>> teeth at you.
	<</if>>
	<<gglove>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 3>><<gharmony>>
	<br><br>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("carnivore")>>
	The Black Wolf looks at the <<recipe_name $gift>> with predatory eyes. <<bHe>> sniffs, then leaps at it, knocking you off your feet. <<bHe>> devours the meal in seconds.<<glove>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster gte 1>>
		<<bHe>> licks <<bhis>> lips. "Tender," <<bhe>> says. "Sweet. No blood. Strange, but I like it."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> licks <<bhis>> lips, then your face, with approval.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	The Black Wolf lies down, contented.
	<br><br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Black Wolf" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Encroaching Civilisation">>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("drink")>>
	The Black Wolf looks at the <<recipe_name $gift>> with predatory eyes. <<bHe>> sniffs, then sticks <<bhis>> tongue in. <<bHe>> laps up the drink, knocking the vessel over in <<bhis>> eagerness, but <<bhe>> seems happy enough to lick it off the floor.<<glove>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster gte 1>>
		"Tasty," <<bhe>> says. "Town water? Don't tell others. They'd take dangerous risks."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> licks your face, in thanks, when finished.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	The Black Wolf lies down, contented.
	<br><br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Black Wolf" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Encroaching Civilisation">>
<<else>>
	The Black Wolf looks at the <<recipe_name $gift>> with predatory eyes. <<bHe>> sniffs, then leaps at it, knocking you off your feet. <<bHe>> bites into the meal, then spits it out, and growls at you.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster gte 1>>
		"That's not food," <<bhe>> says. "It's got plants in it. You tricked me."
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">Perhaps <<bhe>> wants something fit for a carnivore.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<bHe>> lies down, and sulks.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Wolf Relax]]>><</link>>
<br>
